### Maven wrapper ###
# Excluded from the blanket *.properties rule above: without this file `./mvnw` cannot
# bootstrap Maven, so the build fails on a clean checkout.
!.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.properties

### Eclipse / VS Code Java build output ###
# Mirrors src/ as compiled .class files; regenerated by the IDE, never committed.
bin/
